## SafeBus Mobile - Local Environment Configuration Example
## Copy this file to 'local.properties' and adjust the path to your Android SDK location.
##
## Windows standard location:
## sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\<YourUser>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
##
## Linux standard location:
## sdk.dir=/home/<youruser>/Android/Sdk
##
## macOS standard location:
## sdk.dir=/Users/<youruser>/Library/Android/sdk
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\Username\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
